We must output revised SHACL fixing syntax error. The error at line with sh:declare list: they used commas between items inside list; correct syntax is separate sh:declare statements separated by . or ; not commas. The prefixes block in sh:sparql should be list of sh:declare triples, each terminated with . Usually:

sh:prefixes [
  sh:declare [
    sh:prefix "vocab" ;
    sh:namespace "https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#" ;
  ] ;
  sh:declare [
    sh:prefix "qudt" ;
    sh:namespace "http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/" ;
  ] ;
  sh:declare [
    sh:prefix "xsd" ;
    sh:namespace "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" ;
  ] ;
] ;

So replace commas with semicolons and proper brackets.

Also ensure overall Turtle syntax is correct: after sh:sparql [ ... ] . The previous shape ends with . after the closing bracket.

Let's rewrite shape fully keeping other stuff same.

Also need to include prefixes at top already defined.

Will output within <BEGIN_SHACL> ... <END_SHACL>.
